  "modifications": "src/emulator.c and src/emulator.h: optional RAM-write observer/filter for ROM-specific sound mailboxes. Null callback preserves upstream behavior. CPU/PPU/APU/Mapper algorithms and ROM bytes are unchanged. See wiiz-ram-observer.patch. Other included upstream files are unchanged. The existing optional callback also covers CPU $6000-$7FFF cartridge RAM for ROM-specific assist freezes; addresses remain CPU addresses, internal mirrors are normalized. Mapper algorithms are unchanged. Optional expansion-port callbacks forward $4016 writes and OR expansion bits into controller reads, outside serialized S. See wiiz-expansion-port.patch. Existing CPU/PPU/APU/mapper execution is retained.",
